ent_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":"建元三年","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p003","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m003-0234","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/114.json"}],"interpretation_note":"被殺、斬或誅按明示個人死亡記錄，三校尉群體不拆姓名；未記地點不補，死亡不自動終止所有稱號。第9段日期承接尚待另核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"normalized_date_range":{"earliest":{"era":"BCE","era_year":139,"year":-138},"latest":{"era":"BCE","era_year":138,"year":-137},"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year_range","basis":"regnal_year_crosses_ce_year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"吳王子子駒亡走閩越，怨東甌殺其父，常勸閩越擊東甌。至建元三年，閩越發兵圍東甌。東甌食盡，困，且降，乃使人告急天子。天子問太尉田蚡，蚡對曰：「越人相攻擊，固其常，又數反覆，不足以煩中國往救也。自秦時棄弗屬。」於是中大夫莊助詰蚡曰：「特患力弗能救，德弗能覆；誠能，何故棄之？且秦舉咸陽而棄之，何乃越也！今小國以窮困來告急天子，天子弗振，彼當安所告愬？又何以子萬國乎？」上曰：「太尉未足與計。吾初即位，不欲出虎符發兵郡國。」乃遣莊助以節發兵會稽。會稽太守欲距不為發兵，助乃斬一司馬，諭意指，遂發兵浮海救東甌。未至，閩越引兵而去。東甌請舉國徙中國，乃悉舉眾來，處江淮之閒。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue","source_id":"s-shiji114-dongyue","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:p003","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-114-dongyue:m003-0234","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/114.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記曆書》索隱·太初改歲首","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記三家註/卷026&oldid=2514838","quote":"然漢始以建亥爲年首，今改以建寅，故以七年爲元年。","scope":"received_calendar_rule","text_layer":"suoyin_commentary","revision_id":2514838,"image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r067-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false,"quote_passage_ref":"data/historical-tables/shiji-022.json"},{"title":"《史記·漢興以來將相名臣年表》","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷022&oldid=2607038","table_id":"shiji-022","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r069-c01","scope":"received_regnal_year_attestation","image_verified":false,"quot